                      ∀ (z : SU.Slot),
                        Witness Y H V Q Qc a_1 (C a_1) (escort Y H V Q Qc 3 false (C 3) a_1 (C a_1) (Ψ.character x))
                          (X' z) z s (Sen (Survival.camp B) B) (booty (Survival.camp B) d q) (Tapestry.cabin ↑n)
                          (1 / 2)) →
              Luminous Y H V Q Qc C Ψ eX Δ s n n' L q d w X' x
